from lib import *
U='b2-chilecentro'
chall('chile-central',{
f'{U}-01':C('Between Two Mountain Ranges','You are Meg. You and Carlos are watching a documentary about Chile, and he asks where most Chileans live.','Tell Carlos where the Central Valley lies, putting the place first.',['Start with the place','Say what lies there'],'Entre los Andes y la cordillera de la Costa se extiende el Valle Central.','The Central Valley lies between the Andes and the Coastal Range.','I can put a place, a time or a quality first to stress it when I describe the Central Valley.'),
f'{U}-02':C('The Means to Go Up the Hills','You are Carlos. You and Meg are planning a trip to Valparaíso, and she asks how people get up to the hills.','Tell Meg what the funiculars are for the people of Valparaíso.',['Say that the funiculars are a means','Say that people go up the hills with them'],'Los ascensores son el medio con el que los porteños suben a los cerros.','The funiculars are the means with which the people of Valparaíso go up the hills.','I can describe the places and ways of Valparaíso with *en la que*, *con el que* and other prepositions with *el que*.'),
f'{U}-03':C('Strictly Speaking, in Parral','You are Meg. You and Carlos are reading an article about Pablo Neruda, and he thinks the poet was born in Isla Negra.','Correct Carlos with the exact truth about where Neruda was born.',['Show that you are being exact','Say where Neruda was born'],'En rigor, Neruda no nació en Isla Negra, sino en Parral.','Strictly speaking, Neruda was not born in Isla Negra but in Parral.','I can show my attitude to a fact about the poets with stance adverbs such as *en realidad*, *en rigor* and *lamentablemente*.'),
f'{U}-04':C('Before the Planes Came','You are Carlos. You and Meg are preparing a talk about 11 September 1973, and she asks what Allende did that morning.','Tell Meg what Allende did before the planes bombed the palace.',['Say what Allende did','Say it was before the bombing'],'Allende habló por radio antes de que los aviones bombardearan el palacio.','Allende spoke on the radio before the planes bombed the palace.','I can put events in order with *antes de que* + subjunctive and *después de que* + indicative.'),
f'{U}-05':C('Although the No Won','You are Meg. You and Carlos are watching a documentary about the 1988 plebiscite, and he asks if Pinochet left office right away.','Tell Carlos that the No won but Pinochet stayed until 1990.',['Grant that the No won','Say what happened next'],'Si bien el plebiscito de 1988 lo ganó el No, Pinochet siguió en el cargo hasta 1990.','Although the No won the 1988 plebiscite, Pinochet stayed in office until 1990.','I can grant a point and say what matters more with *si bien* + indicative.'),
f'{U}-consolidation':C('Central Chile in Review','You are Carlos. You and Meg are preparing a short talk about central Chile, and she asks when Valparaíso became a World Heritage Site.','Tell Meg the year in which UNESCO declared Valparaíso a World Heritage Site.',['Say the year','Say what UNESCO declared'],'El año en el que la UNESCO declaró el casco histórico de Valparaíso Patrimonio de la Humanidad fue 2003.','The year in which UNESCO declared the historic quarter of Valparaíso a World Heritage Site was 2003.','I can review what I learned about central Chile, from the Central Valley to the constitutional votes.')})
